{"id":15316683107,"name":"The Nearly Impossible Obby","desc":"Challenge your skills in The Nearly Impossible Obby, a thrilling platformer adventure with 265 stages of escalating difficulty. Do you have what it takes to conquer all of the obstacles and emerge the Obby Master? Only 1% can, good luck...\n\nLiking the game but it gets too difficult for you? No worries, once you have completed at least 60 stages—you can Rebirth for gems allowing you to unlock unique trails and halos. In addition, you can compete for a spot on the Rebirth leaderboard!\n\nPress R to go back to your stage, or Y if you are on controller. \n\nTags: Obby, Parkour, Platformer, Obstacle Course, Tower, Easy, Hard, Impossible, Difficulty Chart, DCO, Lava","path":"/game/15316683107-the-nearly-impossible-obby","slug":"15316683107-the-nearly-impossible-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e5ceabfc20ef2803c3edf96910ca73354594c1789c3386b520a878eceb9aee96.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-86bd9852cd51ed65ee6277390bf21fc6/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":5,"visitor":32528843,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-11-08T14:59:42.839Z","creator":{"name":"Big Dream Studios.","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"The-Nearly-Impossible-Obby-auto-complete-21867","_id":"672e275e546a0a24da939685","title":"auto complete","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c78c47","gameId":15316683107,"name":"The Nearly Impossible Obby","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":15316683107},"features":"-- automatically completes obby in a few seconds","tags":[],"script":"local ezobby = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal kitty = workspace.Checkpoints\nlocal function meow()\n    local thingies = 265 -- these are the checkpoints \n    for i = 1, thingies do\n        local skillissue = kitty:FindFirstChild(tostring(i))\n        if skillissue then\n            local grr = skillissue.CFrame * CFrame.new(0, 4, 0)\n            ezobby.Character:SetPrimaryPartCFrame(grr)\n            task.wait(0.07)\n        end\n    end\nend\nmeow()","owner":{"_id":"624f7b9a1a09f822115964c3","username":"ktty","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/facf40d97681aa802215192a0de97b9a248d36b6314ae27a208d1e1b6a3ae658.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/624f7b9a1a09f822115964c3-1729327305330.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"624f7b9a1a09f822115964c3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":5},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/facf40d97681aa802215192a0de97b9a248d36b6314ae27a208d1e1b6a3ae658.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/624f7b9a1a09f822115964c3-1729327305330.jpg"}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":1134,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","createdAt":"2024-11-08T14:59:42.839Z","dislikeCount":0,"likeCount":1,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c4b37aebf1a1ba3473ffa352d992fbb2262544c7db90fb35782b89e1a881aae1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/15316683107-1731077982811.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/15316683107-1731077982811.png"},"executes":31,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-18T02:18:07.657Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c4b37aebf1a1ba3473ffa352d992fbb2262544c7db90fb35782b89e1a881aae1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/15316683107-1731077982811.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/15316683107-1731077982811.png"},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"67e5e1e3b360710ec3c4d03b","editBy":{"_id":"624f7b9a1a09f822115964c3","username":"ktty","status":"offline","id":"624f7b9a1a09